  id: barks_gorrath
  displayName: Gorrath
  description: 
  cooldownSeconds: 4
  lines:
  - trigger: 0
    text: "Silahs\u0131z m\u0131 geldin? Tarikat\u0131n aptall\u0131\u011F\u0131 \xF6lmemi\u015F."
  - trigger: 2
    text: "\u0130mkans\u0131z!"
  - trigger: 3
    text: "Hep ayn\u0131 numara."
  - trigger: 5
    text: Yeter! Kuyu seni yutacak!
  - trigger: 4
    text: Bu kat... benim...
  - trigger: 6
    text: "Usta... seni... iyi yeti\u015Ftirmi\u015F..."
